      "text": "[7:03PM] #Sangotedo #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement from both inward and outward Ado Badore road en-route Alesh and Abraham Adesanya.\n\nMovement from Abraham Adesanya both inward and outward Ogombo road is good.\n\nFrom Lekki-Gardens Phase 2, Alasia, LBS, Sangotedo, Ogidan before Jonaith bridge is also experiencing smooth ride to DKK supermarket.\n\nOnward journey from DKK to ShopRite by Peace Garden Estate turning is good.\n\nFrom ShopRite to Majeek, Abijo, Awoyaya School Gate, Lakowe, Bogije, Frajend and down to Eleko junction is also good.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
