      "text": "[7:26PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nFor now, traffic is calm along the service lane at Anthony inward Maryland intersection, and onwards Odo'yalaro and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way respectively.\n\nMovement is good at both sides of Kodesoh Road, Local Airport Road, Oba Akinjobi Way, and Ikeja G.R.A respectively.\n\nHowever, our personnel are on ground controlling traffic at their respective locations to ensure smooth flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
