      "text": "[7:37PM] #IyanaOworo #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic conditions are favorable with smooth movement on key routes.\nIyana Oworo to Ilaje and Adekunle is flowing well in both directions, and Iyana Oworo to Gbagada and Olamide Badoo is also moving smoothly. \nBariga axis is gridlock-free with fluid traffic from Deeper Life to Baale. \nMovement is relatively smooth towards Muritala and Bariga Roundabout, as well as from Ilaje Chemist to UNILAG Gate and Abule Oja. \nThe return journey from UNILAG Gate to Baale is proceeding without issues, thanks to diligent traffic management by LASTMA officers who are on ground to ensure free flow of movement.  \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
