      "text": "[8:17PM] #Marina #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is moving appreciably from UBA Roundabout to NITEL intersection, and perfectly from Zone 2 underpass to Bonny Camp. \nMovement is also good from Onikan Roundabout to NITEL intersection and from Inner Marina Road to McWen Bridge. \nThe entire stretch of Broad Street, Tinubu Street, Martins Junction, and David Street is clear, with Balogun to Apongbon moving smoothly. \nAdditionally, Catholic Mission Street to Ganiu Smith Street is good.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
