      "text": "[8:45PM] #Dopemu #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is moving well from Dopemu underpass inw Adealu, Goye intersection to Alaguntan Alimosho road, and Dopemu bridge to Akowonjo roundabout and beyond.\n\nThe return journey from Egbeda to Lagos-Abeokuta Expressway is also smooth.\n\nHowever, there's slow movement from Ogunlana junction to Egbeda due to bus activities, though traffic is still moving.\n\nOfficers are on ground managing traffic with no impediments reported.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
